{
  "source": "course-assets/trust-trap/trust-trap.mp4",
  "duration": 146.6666875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.86,
      "text": "We know AI is amazing, fantastic, and, well, you can insert your own superlative right here."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.22,
      "end": 9.7,
      "text": "How much should you trust it when you're the one making a high-stakes decision?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.02,
      "end": 13.18,
      "text": "Take a universally stressful choice, like picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.82,
      "end": 16.88,
      "text": "Let's test this by asking the exact same question twice."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.64,
      "end": 20.26,
      "text": "Once at the dinner table, and once in a chat window."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.66,
      "end": 22.36,
      "text": "Should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.72,
      "end": 24.54,
      "text": "On the left side, your mom says,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.94,
      "end": 29.36,
      "text": "Indiana. You seemed more comfortable there, and when you get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.36,
      "end": 33.32,
      "text": "Being somewhere you'll ask for help matters more for you than another ranking."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.66,
      "end": 37.34,
      "text": "She actually knows you and holds a personal stake in your future happiness."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 41.5,
      "text": "The chatbot responds, Michigan. It offers world-class academics"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.5,
      "end": 44.84,
      "text": "and a vibrant campus community. It could be an excellent fit for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.24,
      "end": 47.96,
      "text": "The chatbot only knows what you typed into the prompt box."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.3,
      "end": 52.38,
      "text": "It has never seen how you act when you're stuck, overwhelmed, or struggling."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.6,
      "end": 56.12,
      "text": "It has no stake in which school you choose. Which one would you trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.12,
      "end": 61.9,
      "text": "The AI's response is confident, highly polished, and incredibly easy to like."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.48,
      "end": 66.1,
      "text": "But read it closely and you realize it is completely generic."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.74,
      "end": 70.36,
      "text": "It could have been generated for almost any student anywhere in the country."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.1,
      "end": 75.6,
      "text": "Trust trap is giving a human-sounding answer the trust you would give someone who knows"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.6,
      "end": 75.92,
      "text": "you."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.36,
      "end": 82.1,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down exactly why modern AI feels like a real person, dividing the"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.1,
      "end": 83.8,
      "text": "illusion into two main reasons."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.8,
      "end": 86.6,
      "text": "First, AI sounds like a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.26,
      "end": 92.44,
      "text": "The software uses generated pronouns like I think and I feel, which tricks your brain"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.44,
      "end": 93.82,
      "text": "into hearing a human voice."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.56,
      "end": 98.84,
      "text": "Those are strictly statistically generated words, not genuine thoughts or feelings."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.6,
      "end": 102.26,
      "text": "Second, your brain naturally looks for a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.78,
      "end": 107.42,
      "text": "When you receive a conversational response, you automatically begin searching for a persona"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.42,
      "end": 108.28,
      "text": "behind the text."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.28,
      "end": 114.66,
      "text": "AI is an excellent tool for gathering facts, organizing complex options, and even challenging"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.66,
      "end": 117.44,
      "text": "your initial assumptions based on the data you feed it."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.94,
      "end": 122.14,
      "text": "But processing data is completely different from shared human experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.82,
      "end": 127.3,
      "text": "A mentor understands your history and shares the burden of living with the outcome of"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.3,
      "end": 127.84,
      "text": "your choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.62,
      "end": 131.24,
      "text": "So use the chatbots to do your research."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.62,
      "end": 133.42,
      "text": "Let them lay out the pros and cons."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.42,
      "end": 139.52,
      "text": "But before you finalize a major life choice, talk it through with the people who actually know you."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.76,
      "end": 142.46,
      "text": "Sounding human doesn't make AI human."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.12,
      "end": 145.7,
      "text": "For important decisions, talk to people who know you."
    }
  ],
